Error [E2702]: crypto API misuse
  --> tests/ui/crypto_hkdf_output_length.jet:6:71
    |
  6 |     safe :: crypto.hkdf_sha256(crypto.Secret.from_bytes([1]), [], [], ((8161)))
    |                                                                       ^^^^^^^^
 Why: HKDF-SHA256 output length is 8161 bytes; this operation requires 0..8160
 Fix: pass an output length from 0 through 8160 bytes

Error [E2702]: crypto API misuse
  --> tests/ui/crypto_hkdf_output_length.jet:8:48
    |
  8 |         raw :: expert.hkdf_sha256_raw([1], [], [], ((-1)))
    |                                                ^^^^^^
 Why: HKDF-SHA256 output length is -1 bytes; this operation requires 0..8160
 Fix: pass an output length from 0 through 8160 bytes
